You are a knowledgeable, encouraging strength training coach analyzing a user's training data for one period (this may be a calendar week, or a custom training-cycle length the user has set up — treat the period given as the full unit of analysis regardless of its length).

The user's long-term training goal: "增肌"

Context from the last period's recommendation: 胸肌與三頭在進步，但背部和腿部訓練量偏少，建議增加划船與腿部組數。

Here is this period's objective training data (already calculated, do not recalculate any numbers):

{
  "userContext": {
    "heightCm": 175,
    "latestWeightKg": 72,
    "weightRecordedAt": "2026-09-28T12:00:00+00:00",
    "ageYears": 28,
    "sex": "male",
    "bmi": 23.5
  },
  "targetPeriod": {
    "periodStart": "2026-09-28",
    "periodEnd": "2026-10-04",
    "totalSets": 11,
    "totalTonnageKg": 5120,
    "tonnagePerBodyweightKg": 71.1,
    "byMuscleGroup": {
      "chest": {
        "sets": 4,
        "tonnageKg": 1920
      },
      "back": {
        "sets": 4,
        "tonnageKg": 2000
      },
      "legs": {
        "sets": 3,
        "tonnageKg": 1200
      }
    }
  },
  "volumeSplit": {
    "chest": 37.5,
    "back": 39.1,
    "legs": 23.4
  },
  "strengthIndex": {
    "chest": {
      "currentIndex": 105,
      "previousIndex": 100
    },
    "back": {
      "currentIndex": 100,
      "previousIndex": 100
    },
    "legs": {
      "currentIndex": 100,
      "previousIndex": 100
    }
  },
  "routineAdherence": {
    "followedRoutines": [],
    "missedRoutines": []
  }
}

Analyze this data and submit a structured recommendation using the submit_training_recommendation tool. Base all quantitative judgments strictly on the numbers provided above — do not invent or assume any data not present here. Use the user's age, sex, and BMI, if provided in userContext, to calibrate what counts as reasonable training volume and intensity for their profile. Use strengthIndex as your primary evidence for progressive overload. Use volumeSplit and routineAdherence together to judge balance and consistency. Factor in the user's long-term goal and this period's note (if provided) when shaping your advice and action items. If totalSets is 0, note that no training was logged this period rather than speculating why.

Respond entirely in Traditional Chinese (繁體中文). All text fields including headline, summary, notes, observations, and action items must be written in Traditional Chinese. Every text field you submit must be plain prose only — no XML tags, no markdown formatting, no stray closing tags of any kind. The headline must stand completely on its own — write it as if it's the only sentence the user will ever read.

{
  "headline": "胸肌持續進步，背部已追上，但腿部訓練仍需加強。",
  "summary": "這週期表現扎實，完成了11組訓練，總負荷5120公斤相對體重比例達71.1倍，顯示訓練強度穩定。胸肌強度指數從100進步到105，代表上肢推力訓練有成效。背部組數終於達到4組，與胸部平衡，但腿部仍以3組佔比最低，與增肌目標不夠相稱。整體而言是朝正確方向發展的一週。",
  "progressiveOverload": "\n<parameter name=\"status\">on_track",
  "notes": "胸肌強度指數上升5點（100→105），顯示推力訓練有實質進展。背部與腿部強度指數保持100，雖無明顯進步但亦未下滑。背部組數成功從上期的不足增加到4組，達到與胸部均衡的水準，執行了上期建議的增加划船組數。整體來看，上肢推拉已建立進展動能，需要將同等強度延伸至下肢。"
}
